This copy contains the parser and excludes renderers, extensions, and the CLI.
The initializer and helpers reflect that subset. Source uses relative imports
to keep the package private. The optional objprint debug helper is excluded.

Local patches follow CommonMark 0.31.2. The HTML block conditions in block.py
and patterns.py follow §4.6, including HTML block tags and CDATA termination.
Links and summary labels decode escapes and entity references together in
one pass, without using Marko's HTML renderer.
